      "writtenOn": "2022-02-16T21:32:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For GrImageTexGenPolicy, options are:\n    // Choose the cheapest way to generate the texture. Use GrResourceCache if appropriate.\n    kDraw,\n    // Always make a new texture that is uncached and unbudgeted.\n    kNew_Uncached_Unbudgeted,\n    // Always make a new texture that is uncached and budgeted.\n    kNew_Uncached_Budgeted\n\nIn Ganesh, for makeTextureImage() we use Uncached_Unbudgeted or Uncached_Budgeted to get the SurfaceProxyView, depending on whether a budgeted request is made. Default is Draw (which is cached). It doesn\u0027t seem like any of this fits our \nresource management plans.",
      "parentUuid": "cdde74ea_194f88f2",
